      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-27T00:17:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Louis told me that the deterministic ECDSA is for providing a constant G2F attestation cert. You\u0027ll want to check with Louis or Andrey.",
      "parentUuid": "04405c6e_bb123347",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 458,
